  "translation": "Gomme dikgoši tša Bafelešte diabela mo go ene, gomme dikgoši tša Bafelešte di re go ene: Boeletša ⟨את⟩ monna yo, a boele go lefelo la gagwe leo o mo beakantšego gona, gomme a seke a theoga le rena ntweng, gomme a se be go rena moganyetsi ntweng; gomme ka eng ye a ka dumelelwa go mong wa gagwe — a ga se ka dihlogweng tša banna bao?",
